## Summary

Add continuous integration to automatically validate builds and tests on every push/PR.

## Proposed Workflow

`.github/workflows/ci.yml`:

```yaml
name: CI

on:
  push:
    branches: [master, main]
  pull_request:
    branches: [master, main]

jobs:
  build:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    
    steps:
    - uses: actions/checkout@v4
    
    - name: Install dependencies
      run: sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install -y libncurses-dev
    
    - name: Build
      run: make
    
    - name: Run tests
      run: make test
    
    - name: Run benchmarks
      run: make benchmark

  lint:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    
    steps:
    - uses: actions/checkout@v4
    
    - name: Install cppcheck
      run: sudo apt-get install -y cppcheck
    
    - name: Static analysis
      run: cppcheck --enable=all --error-exitcode=1 src/
```

## Badge

Add to README:
```markdown
[![CI](https://github.com/jcaldwell-labs/terminal-stars/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/jcaldwell-labs/terminal-stars/actions/workflows/ci.yml)
```

## Benefits

- Catch build failures early
- Validate PRs automatically
- Build status badge shows project health
- Consistent with modern open source practices
